What:		/sys/bus/platform/devices/*/sci/tx_active
Date:		August 2026
Contact:	linux-serial@vger.kernel.org
Description:
		Read-only transmit transaction state.  One means that the driver is
		feeding, or has paused while feeding, the transmit FIFO.  Hardware may
		finish draining after the driver performs the original early
		receive-direction hand-off.

